      "look": [
        0,
        2.2,
        -6
      ],
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "Remains, by the vessels: a monk, dead long enough for the clan to have built something over the top of him.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "And a wall that is still showing pictures.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "That is a Photo-audio Gu, and it is nearly finished.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "seconds": 1.2
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "What the wall shows does not match what the village celebrates every spring.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Watch it three times. Be able to repeat it without an error, in case the chance to watch it goes away.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "flag",
      "set": "know.image-wall"
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 16,
      "text": "What he left at the mouth"
