    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "The worm is faster than he is, and it has no reason to trust a jar twice.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Two nights more than I wanted to spend on this.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 18,
      "text": "Methods he will not use"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "The clan has a procedure for this. The procedure requires telling the clan.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "An advantage announced is an advantage surrendered. So: the other thing.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 19,
      "text": "Pressure"
    },
